SUMMARY:Vintage Art\,  Frames\, Mini Toys & Figurines
DESCRIPTION:A collection of 150+ vintage artwork\, frames\, needlework **and** assorted toy “fantasy” figurines and toy wild animals have been donated to the Graton Community Club from local estates. \nAll items are sold “as is” and are priced to sell!   Many of the toy animal figures are the “Schleich” brand\, some still in their original packaging. No holds\, first-come\, first serve. \nThis is a 2-day sale (Fri-Sat.\,Aug. 21-22\, from 9am-1pm) at the Graton Community Club. Sale proceeds will benefit the non-profit work of the Club. Share the news with your “collector” friends! Thank you for your support over the years! \nA small sampling is shown in the photo collage shown. For more details and a full photo gallery – check out the Flckr web pages below: \n*** Vintage Art + Frames ***\n \n*** Fantasy Figurines ***\n \n*** Animals: “Lions+Tigers+Bears\, Oh My!” ***\n \n*** Embroidery Art ***
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/vintage-art-frames-mini-toys-figurines/2026-08-22/
LOCATION:Graton Community Club\, 8996 Graton Road\, Graton\, CA\, 95444\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GCC-art-saleAug2026.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Graton Community Club":MAILTO:kessel@sonic.net
END:VEVENT
