SUMMARY:Whole Grain Sourdough featuring Farmer Mai Wheat
DESCRIPTION:Discover the flavor of freshly milled\, locally grown grains while learning to mix\, ferment\, and shape whole grain sourdough with baker Dan Ferreira of Bedstone Baking. \nIn this workshop you’ll:\n* Taste and compare Farmer Mai’s Sonora and Marquis wheat with an introduction to Abruzzi rye\n* Learn how freshly milled flour changes hydration\, fermentation\, and dough handling\n* Mix and shape 2 loaves to ferment and bake at home \nSome bread-baking experience is recommended.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/whole-grain-sourdough-featuring-farmer-mai-wheat/
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol\, 122 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Skill-Building Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Whole-Wheat-Sourdough.png
END:VEVENT
