SUMMARY:SBC # 575 Sonoma Clean Power CEO\, Geof Syphers – Getting to 100% Renewable Energy – 600 MW of new local geothermal power?
DESCRIPTION:Come for a fun electric science demo and Monday night meet Geof Syphers\, CEO and leader of the Sonoma Clean Power mission – getting to 100% renewable energy. SCP is proposing to build up to 600 MW of new local geothermal power. How will they do that? Also\, join us for a fun electric science demo featuring Nicola! \nSCP is partnering with Eavor and seeking additional partners to build advanced\, low-water systems that can extract heat without needing to inject large amounts of wastewater into the ground\, which also limits seismic risks. Residents and businesses in Sonoma and Mendocino counties can access this\npower by enrolling in SCP’s EverGreen premium service. EverGreen guarantees 100% renewable power day and night by combining local solar\,\nbatteries and geothermal.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/sbc-575-sonoma-clean-power-ceo-geof-syphers-getting-to-100-renewable-energy-600-mw-of-new-local-geothermal-power/
LOCATION:Hopmonk Sebastopol\, 230 Petaluma Ave\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Columbia-photo.jpg
END:VEVENT
