SUMMARY:Beginning Crochet: Next Steps
DESCRIPTION:Ready to move beyond the basics? In this two-part workshop\, you’ll build confidence with the techniques that unlock a wider world of crochet patterns\, projects\, and creative possibilities. \n• Learn to crochet in the round\, increase stitches\, and follow a simple written pattern\n• Master the versatile corner-to-corner (C2C) technique while creating a finished cloth\n• Build confidence reading your stitches and finishing projects with clean edges and woven ends \nCompletion of Beginning Crochet Fundamentals or equivalent experience is recommended. Materials not included.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/beginning-crochet-next-steps/2026-08-25/
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol\, 122 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Skill-Building Workshop
