SUMMARY:West African Drum  Workshop with Grandmaster Bolokada Conde
DESCRIPTION:One of Guinea’s most premier djembefolas is coming to Sebastopol! Conde takes pride in sharing the Malinke rhythms\, songs\, and culture with sheer passion\, patience\, and remarkable zeal. \nDrum godfather Mamady Keita called Bolokada: “A brilliant and entertaining performer\, a patient and precise teacher\, and one of the few masters of his instrument. Few are able to captivate his audience as he does\, and even fewer are able to clearly and concisely teach this music.” \nDrummers of all levels are welcome. Pay to register. Space is limited. $45 in advance. $50 at door.\nVenmo: @Kimberly-Sanders-9
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/west-african-drum-workshop-with-grandmaster-bolokada-conde/
LOCATION:Sebastopol Ballet School\, 8196 Bodega Ave\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472-9630\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults, generally
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Final-Bolokada-Poster-Sebastopol-2026.png
END:VEVENT
